  "metadata": {
    "title": "Curated EU Legislative Procedure Aliases",
    "description": "Maps natural-language procedure names and nicknames to formal procedure references (COD/NLE/CNS/RSP) and lead committees. Used by the committee-transcript chatbot path so users can ask 'What did LIBE say about the ePrivacy Directive extension?' without typing '2025/0429(COD)'. Aliases drawn from MEP usage, Politico EU, EurActiv, EDRi, BEUC, Bruegel and civil society shorthand.",
    "last_updated": "2026-04-20",
    "source": "OEIL + EP committee assignments + Brussels-bubble media; manually curated for high-profile procedures"
  },
